sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(231,240,235) Choreography
    participant Order
    participant Inventory
    participant Payment
    end
    Order->>Inventory: OrderCreated
    Inventory->>Payment: InventoryReserved
    Payment->>Order: PaymentProcessed
    Payment-->>Inventory: PaymentFailed → release
    Note over Order,Payment: Services react to events. There is no application coordinator.

    box rgb(246,238,216) Orchestration
    participant Orchestrator
    participant Ord as Order
    participant Inv as Inventory
    participant Pay as Payment
    end
    Orchestrator->>Ord: 1. Create pending order
    Ord-->>Orchestrator: Created
    Orchestrator->>Inv: 2. Reserve inventory
    Inv-->>Orchestrator: Reserved
    Orchestrator->>Pay: 3. Charge (pivot)
    Note over Orchestrator,Pay: On failure after a completed step, compensate in reverse.
